5,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I believe we should start by examining the actual utility of past projects.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I agree. It is crucial to understand how space is utilized after completion.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,I am interested in the operational side. We must consider the people maintaining these facilities.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I am concerned about the recurring delays in our project timelines. We need to see why schedules slip.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,A fascinating start. I suspect our budget projections are perhaps a bit too optimistic for the real world.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Victoria, if we look at the reviews, we can avoid repeating past mistakes.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,Precisely. I also want to know how construction affects the daily academic schedule.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,I will look into the staffing levels. It has been a long time since we added new posts.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Benjamin, if you suspect budget issues, we should look at the tender records to see the gap between bids and reality.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Mizuki, you read my mind. I shall also investigate the renewal reserves to see if we are underfunding maintenance.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
