16,1,3,pass,Victoria,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,I will also check the manual routines of the technicians. The burden on them is often invisible.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I will also examine the delivery schedules by project rationale to identify patterns of delay.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
